# EAS Metadata pulls the FULL App Store listing into this file. It is never
# committed: a partial store.config.json is something `eas metadata:push` could
# send at an app under review. The committed, reviewed subset of the age-rating
# declaration lives at store/apple-advisory.json - see store/README.md.
store.config.json

# Raw ElevenLabs render output. Masters live off-repo in Drive
